            <h3 data-number="5.1.5" id="record-identifier"><span
            class="header-section-number">5.1.5</span> Record
            Identifier</h3>
            <p><strong>Element name:</strong> &lt;<a
            href="http://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#recordID">lido:recordID</a>&gt;</p>
            <p><strong>Note:</strong> The Record Identifier element is a
            text string uniquely identifying the record in the
            contributor’s database or other recordkeeping system. It
            serves as a reference for all communication with the
            originator concerning the contents of the metadata
            record.</p>
            <p><strong>Example:</strong> The following example shows the
            local identifier for the record describing the “<a
            href="https://www.bildindex.de/document/obj00076417">Mona
            Lisa</a>” provided by Deutsches Dokumentationszentrum für
            Kunstgeschichte - Bildarchiv Foto Marburg.</p>
            <blockquote>
            <p><strong>Record Identifier:</strong> obj00076417
            <strong><em>Type:</em></strong> Local identifier |
            <strong>Source:</strong> Deutsches Dokumentationszentrum für
            Kunstgeschichte - Bildarchiv Foto Marburg</p>
            </blockquote>
            <div class="sourceCode" id="cb23"><pre
            class="sourceCode xml"><code class="sourceCode xml"><span id="cb23-1"><a href="#cb23-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>&lt;<span class="kw">lido:recordID</span></span>
<span id="cb23-2"><a href="#cb23-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="ot">    lido:source=</span><span class="st">&quot;Deutsches Dokumentationszentrum für Kunstgeschichte - Bildarchiv Foto Marburg&quot;</span></span>
<span id="cb23-3"><a href="#cb23-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="ot">    lido:type=</span><span class="st">&quot;http://terminology.lido-schema.org/lido00100&quot;</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb23-4"><a href="#cb23-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    obj00076417</span>
<span id="cb23-5"><a href="#cb23-5" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>&lt;/<span class="kw">lido:recordID</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div>
            <h3 data-number="5.1.6" id="record-type"><span
            class="header-section-number">5.1.6</span> Record Type</h3>
            <p><strong>Element name:</strong> &lt;<a
            href="http://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#recordType">lido:recordType</a>&gt;</p>
            <p><strong>Note:</strong> The Record Type element indicates
         